WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.350
Guile’s DI catches Cammy near his corner.

2
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.050
Cammy enters the kneeling portion of the DI crumple.

3
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:04.550
Standing heavy kick hits after the delayed crumple wait.

4
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.550
The heavy Sonic Hurricane continues the delayed conversion.

5
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.150
Guile jumps forward over Cammy after the Super.

6
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:06.850
Guile advances after landing on the other side.

7
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:07.350
Guile is now outside the corner with Cammy on the opposite side.
